        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About <i>Pachi-Pachi Typing</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pachi-Pachi Typing</i> is a game that combines the short-ST (Special Time) experience of pachinko with the score-attack style of a typing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By winning the lottery draw, players enter either “Live Bonus” or “Special Live Bonus” mode, during which they can type to earn points.<br>The duration of each bonus mode differs, and when the timer expires, another lottery draw begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through this cycle, players aim for high scores based on both luck and skill.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● Typing Words</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game mainly features terminology from <strong>pachinko and slot machines</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Words you've fully typed will be added to your <strong>Dictionary</strong>, where you'll be able to read explanations — this feature is planned for future implementation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters, etc.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters such as <strong>Tsukasa Sasaoka</strong> and <strong>Himeka Sakura</strong> appear, shared with other <i>Honwaka-Fuwafuwa</i> titles like <i>Replay Bell Suika Slot-Like Game</i>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About <i>Pachi-Pachi Typing</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pachi-Pachi Typing</i> is a game that combines the short-ST (Special Time) experience of pachinko with the score-attack style of a typing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By winning the lottery draw, players enter either “Live Bonus” or “Special Live Bonus” mode, during which they can type to earn points.<br>The duration of each bonus mode differs, and when the timer expires, another lottery draw begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through this cycle, players aim for high scores based on both luck and skill.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >● Typing Words</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game mainly features terminology from <strong>pachinko and slot machines</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Words you've fully typed will be added to your <strong>Dictionary</strong>, where you'll be able to read explanations — this feature is planned for future implementation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters, etc.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters such as <strong>Tsukasa Sasaoka</strong> and <strong>Himeka Sakura</strong> appear, shared with other <i>Honwaka-Fuwafuwa</i> titles like <i>Replay Bell Suika Slot-Like Game</i>.</p>",
        "short_description": "A game that combines the excitement of pachinko’s ST mode with typing gameplay. Score points by typing during bonus rounds in a score attack challenge! A dictionary feature is planned for future implementation.",
